==French==

===Etymology===
From {{m|fr|bider||to trot}}, of {{unk|fr|title=unknown}} ultimate origin. Possibly from {{der|fr|cel-pro|*bid||small}}, related to {{cog|ga|bídeach||small}} and Medieval {{cog|it|bidetto||small horse}}; possibly from a lost {{der|fr|frm|rabider||go quickly, violently}}, a descendant of {{der|fr|la|rabidus||furious, fierce}}, with loss of the initial prefix.

Modern sense derives from analogy with the straddling of a bidet and the straddling of a small horse.<ref>https://www.etymonline.com/word/bidet</ref>

